	"Name": "AlertQuery - Okta - Lifecycle - Policy - Okta Policy Deleted",
	"Description": "An Okta policy was deleted. Deleting a policy removes whatever protection it enforced, so an adversary who has reached the admin console may delete an MFA or sign-on policy to weaken authentication before moving on.\n\nEvent type: policy.lifecycle.delete\n\nReference(s):\n- https://detection.fyi/elastic/detection-rules/integrations/okta/defense_evasion_okta_attempt_to_delete_okta_policy/\n- https://github.com/elastic/detection-rules/blob/main/rules/integrations/okta/defense_evasion_okta_attempt_to_delete_okta_policy.toml",
